This seems weird if info is being assigned above to the pdev. Maybe it 
would be clearer if done in an else branch instead:

	down_write(&cxl_rwsem.dpa);
	if (!pdev->hdm) {
		pdev->hdm = info;
		info = NULL;
	} else {
		cxl_pci_hdm_info_free(info);
