+	/*
+	 * Recovery opcodes do not require DMA data TREs, only CONFIG
+	 * (for set_config) and GO TREs. Since gpi_prep_slave_sg() is
+	 * shared with SPI, verify the channel is I2C before accessing
+	 * the configuration data.
